  "body": "The new compile-only Cg SDK pipeline completed one authenticated hosted request: **negative result retained**, producer `FAILED`, compiler starts `1`, no retry. Independent acceptance authenticates exact reviewed sourceCI/request/run/job/artifact/carrier; candidate/image installation and target execution remain disabled.\n\nActual run: https://github.com/rownlvh8875-coder/big-model-closed-loop-benchmark/actions/runs/43764042768\n\nValidation: focused44 CPU tests; full local1755cases1748PASS7skip including genuine spacious-shm capacity. One fresh wholebranch review, one RED\u2192GREEN pass for3Important issues (compiler selection, complete accessor/string-copy target, durable negative logs/commands). Minor M1 configuration delta reporting is deferred. Exact sourceCI4jobs pass; final docs-only HEAD CI and fresh preservation are recorded in the outside-commit receipt.\n\n7136basefiles/modes,299pins,10originals,priorDrafts102\u2013122,main,native8/image3/mapping/dispatch/realGLX histories and31sibling scratch trees/3846hashes preserved. Existing260source identities and frozen SDK/image unchanged; build source282 closed. All rulings/costs and deferred Minor are in docs/evidence/panda-sdk-cg-candidate-01/rulings-and-deferred.md.\n\nThe compiler succeeded in170.368s but static qualification failed: frozen integer parser does not support CET prefix; independent bytes/descriptor show all3offsets16bytes early, and the descriptor object includes initialization/relocations. These are retained diagnostics, not permission to relax the consumed gate. Static pass would be selected-layout evidence only. Full ABI, prior abort repair, runtime binding and scientific equality remain unqualified; strict0/4FAIL/Stage7INCOMPLETE. No SDK/Panda/GL/Xvfb/officialmodel/ORT/cohort run, image transform, main/sharedbase merge or Cloud/registry publication.\n\nResult: docs/STAGE7_PANDA_SDK_CG_CANDIDATE_RESULT.md. Actual evidence: docs/evidence/panda-sdk-cg-candidate-01/actual. Final exac